{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01263","headline":"相和歌辞 蜀道难 · 张文琮","name":"相和歌辞 蜀道难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梁山镇地险，积石阻云端。\n深谷下寥廓，层岩上郁盘。\n飞梁架绝岭，栈道接危峦。\n揽辔独长息，方知斯路难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}